 Πάω να τον σκοτώσω και γω!


00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:01.000


00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:16.800
<i> This is the Patriotic Partisan Brigade</i>
<i>for the Liberation of ltaly.</i>


00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:21.000
<i>Within the last few minutes</i>
<i>we have seized the radio station in Milan.</i>


00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.000
<i>The city has been liberated.</i>


00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.000
<i>A free Milan salutes its fellow countrymen.</i>


00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:31.200
<i>I repeat, this is the Patriotic Partisan</i>
<i>Brigade for the Liberation of Italy.</i>


00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.200
<i>In the excitement and joy</i>
<i>of this memorable moment,</i>


00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:37.600
<i>our thoughts must go</i>
<i>to those who gave their lives</i>


00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:41.600
<i>to bring an end to</i>
<i>the enslavement of ltaly by the Nazis.</i>


00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.200
<i>But our thoughts, above all, go to...</i>


00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:48.200
Λέο, τί κάνεις εδώ;?


00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:50.600
Δεν σε είδα.


00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.600
Λέο, τί είναι αυτές οι βλακείες;
Δωσε μου το όπλο.


00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:57.400
Αστο!


00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.400
- Ζήτω ο Στάλιν.
- Τρελάθηκες;


00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:05.600
<i>..Η Ταξιαρχεία των Παρτιζάνων</i>
